    "name": "Holy Chain",
    "level": 13,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["divine", "holy", "invested", "noisy"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "player-core-2"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This suit of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "+2 resilient chain mail",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is made of fine white links of a strange and slightly translucent pale metal, and the sleeves and skirt are fashioned into smaller trails that resemble feathers. Unlike normal chain mail, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "holy chain",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " has no Speed reduction, its armor check penalty is 0, and its Bulk is 1."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to AC and saving throws against fiends. You appear radiant while you wear the armor, giving you a +2 item bonus to Diplomacy checks against all creatures except fiends."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If you're unholy, you're "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b",
            "label": "Drained 2"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " while wearing "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "holy chain",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". You can't recover from this condition while wearing the armor."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Celestial Flight",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (concentrate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per day"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The armor sprouts glowing wings that grant you a fly Speed of 30 feet. The wings shed bright light in a 40-foot radius (and dim light to the next 40 feet). The wings fade away after 10 minutes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "cbe3d144-da06-542b-82a1-8fe11364bb4a"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Craft Requirements",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You're holy."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
