            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is designed to make you look like a horned demon with your face peering out of the screaming maw of the beast."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "While wearing the armor, you can attack with the helmet's horns. They're a martial melee weapon with the effects of a +2 weapon potency rune. They deal 2d8 piercing damage and have the deadly d12 and unholy traits. On a critical hit with the horns, the target must succeed at a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:fortitude",
            "dc": 30,
            "options": ["inflicts:drained"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " or become "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b",
            "label": "Drained 1"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (or "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b",
            "label": "Drained 2"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " on a critical failure). The horns can't be etched with any runes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If you're holy, you're "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "fa3d4a94-c2f9-519b-b0a3-82d2612e188b",
            "label": "Drained 2"
          },
